  partName: Intake Runner
  description: The Intake Runner is a crucial component located at the middle-center-center
    of the V8 engine, responsible for channeling air-fuel mixture into the cylinders.
    Made of Chrome.001, its elongated shape and medium size allow for efficient airflow,
    which is essential for optimal engine performance. Interestingly, the Intake
    Runner's design and material help to minimize pressure drop and maximize power
    output.
